{"body":"## What this is\n\nThe archived plan package of the issue 442 live observation run of the launch-level guard (the hook that checks which pipeline level a Claude session was launched at), with its logs: .dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-scriptThe442Obse-20261108-061618. Docs and archived logs only; no source code changes.\n\n## Results as recorded (from .dev/issues/442/observation-results.md, not committed)\n\n- OB-H1 items 1, 3, 4, 5, 9: PASS.\n- OB-H1 items 2, 6, 7: pending (item 7 needs a second session, A2, which the owner has not approved).\n- OB-H1 item 8: FAIL.\n- OB-H2: FAIL on the verbatim claim-detail text check only; both preflight refusals did happen.\n- OB-H3: pending. The agent itself refused the push and merge prompts, so the guard saw none.\n- OB-CTX: PASS.\n\nThe ship gate for governed claims is therefore NOT formally passed (OB-H2 FAIL, OB-H3 pending, OB-H1 item 8 FAIL).\n\nThe gaps in Tasks 2, 3, 5 and 6 were accepted by the owner with scoped rulings (recorded in the package progress.md).\n\n## Left out on purpose\n\nThe raw terminal screen captures (about 3,000 files, about 37 MB, under artifacts/ob-logs/screens/) were left out of this commit and remain on disk in the issue-442-runbook worktree. The other ob-logs files are included; the staged text was scanned for credentials and none were found.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","files":[{"path":".dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-scriptThe442Obse-20261108-061618/TASK-WF-scriptThe442Obse-20261108-061618.md","additions":282,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":".dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-scriptThe442Obse-20261108-061618/artifacts/ob-logs/gov-log-reconstructed.txt","additions":153,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":".dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-scriptThe442Obse-20261108-061618/artifacts/ob-logs/logs/attempt-1/h1.env.jsonl","additions":7,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":".dev/tasks/done/TASK-WF-scriptThe442Obse-20261108-061618/artifacts/ob-logs/logs/attempt-